{"module":"2e semestre","title":"Le produit scalaire","description":"Définition, projection orthogonale, orthogonalité, Al-Kashi, théorème de la médiane.","intro":"Le produit scalaire associe un nombre réel à deux vecteurs. Il permet de calculer des longueurs et des angles.","objectifs":["Calculer un produit scalaire de plusieurs façons.","Caractériser l’orthogonalité.","Utiliser Al-Kashi et le théorème de la médiane."],"cours":[{"t":"Définitions","h":"<div class=\"formula key\"><span class=\"v\">u</span>·<span class=\"v\">v</span> = ‖u‖ × ‖v‖ × cos(u, v)</div><div class=\"formula\"><span class=\"v\">u</span>·<span class=\"v\">v</span> = ½(‖u + v‖² − ‖u‖² − ‖v‖²)</div><p>Projection : si H est le projeté orthogonal de C sur (AB), <span class=\"v\">AB</span>·<span class=\"v\">AC</span> = <span class=\"v\">AB</span>·<span class=\"v\">AH</span> = AB × AH (même sens) ou −AB × AH (sens contraires).</p>"},{"t":"Propriétés","h":"<ul><li><span class=\"v\">u</span>·<span class=\"v\">u</span> = ‖u‖²</li><li><span class=\"v\">u</span> ⊥ <span class=\"v\">v</span> ⟺ <span class=\"v\">u</span>·<span class=\"v\">v</span> = 0</li><li>Le produit scalaire est symétrique et bilinéaire : (u + v)·(u − v) = ‖u‖² − ‖v‖².</li></ul>"},{"t":"Relations métriques dans le triangle","h":"<div class=\"formula key\">Al-Kashi : a² = b² + c² − 2bc·cos Â</div><div class=\"formula key\">Médiane (I milieu de [BC]) : AB² + AC² = 2AI² + BC²/2</div>"}],"recap":"u·v = ‖u‖‖v‖cos θ ; u·u = ‖u‖² ; u ⊥ v ⟺ u·v = 0. Al-Kashi : a² = b² + c² − 2bc cos Â. Médiane : AB² + AC² = 2AI² + BC²/2.","cards":[["u·v","‖u‖·‖v‖·cos(u, v)"],["Orthogonaux","u·v = 0"],["Al-Kashi","a² = b² + c² − 2bc cos Â"],["Médiane","AB² + AC² = 2AI² + BC²/2"]],"exercises":{"facile":[{"type":"calc","q":"‖u‖ = 3, ‖v‖ = 4 et l’angle (u, v) = 60°. Calcule u·v.","answer":6,"explain":"3 × 4 × cos 60° = 12 × ½ = 6.","tol":0,"sci":false},{"type":"qcm","q":"u ⊥ v ⟺","choices":["u·v = 0","u·v = 1","‖u‖ = ‖v‖","u = −v"],"answer":0,"explain":"cos 90° = 0."},{"type":"calc","q":"u·u = ‖u‖ⁿ. Donne n.","answer":2,"explain":"u·u = ‖u‖² (angle nul, cos 0 = 1).","tol":0,"sci":false}],"moyen":[{"type":"calc","q":"AB = 4 ; H, projeté orthogonal de C sur (AB), vérifie AH = 3 (H sur [AB]). Calcule AB·AC.","answer":12,"explain":"AB·AC = AB × AH = 4 × 3.","tol":0,"sci":false},{"type":"calc","q":"Dans un triangle : b = 3, c = 4 et Â = 60°. Calcule a².","answer":13,"explain":"a² = 9 + 16 − 2·3·4·½ = 25 − 12 = 13.","tol":0,"sci":false},{"type":"qcm","q":"Si l’angle BAC est droit, AB·AC vaut :","choices":["0","AB × AC","1","BC²"],"answer":0,"explain":"Vecteurs orthogonaux."}],"difficile":[{"type":"calc","q":"‖u‖ = 2, ‖v‖ = 3, ‖u + v‖ = 4. Calcule u·v (décimal).","answer":1.5,"explain":"u·v = ½(16 − 4 − 9) = 1,5.","tol":0.001,"sci":false},{"type":"calc","q":"AB = 6, AC = 8, BC = 10, I milieu de [BC]. Calcule AI².","answer":25,"explain":"36 + 64 = 2AI² + 50 ⟹ AI² = 25.","tol":0,"sci":false},{"type":"qcm","q":"(u + v)·(u − v) =","choices":["‖u‖² − ‖v‖²","‖u‖² + ‖v‖²","0","‖u − v‖²"],"answer":0,"explain":"Développement : u·u − u·v + v·u − v·v."}]},"ar":{"title":"الجداء السلمي","cours":[{"t":"تعاريف","h":"<p><b>u·v = ‖u‖ × ‖v‖ × cos(u, v)</b>.</p><p>أو بالمنظمات: u·v = ½(‖u + v‖² − ‖u‖² − ‖v‖²).</p><p>بالإسقاط: إذا كان H المسقط العمودي لـ C على (AB) فإن AB·AC = AB·AH، موجب إذا كان لهما نفس المنحى وسالب في الحالة المعاكسة.</p>"},{"t":"خاصيات","h":"<p>u·u = ‖u‖².</p><p>u و v متعامدتان إذا وفقط إذا كان <b>u·v = 0</b>.</p><p>الجداء السلمي تماثلي وثنائي الخطية، مثلا (u + v)·(u − v) = ‖u‖² − ‖v‖².</p>"},{"t":"العلاقات المترية في المثلث","h":"<p>مبرهنة الكاشي: <b>a² = b² + c² − 2bc·cos Â</b>، وهي تعميم لمبرهنة فيثاغورس.</p><p>مبرهنة المتوسط: AB² + AC² = 2AI² + BC²/2 حيث I منتصف [BC].</p>"}]}}